# The model gateway (docs/guide/how-models.md).
title: A direct model call resolves its lane, passes the breaker, and lands priced in the actions log
direction: down
verb: A verb that calls a model directly
resolve: Resolve the lane: config override or registry default
family: Family check for review-type calls
breaker: Budget breaker: refuse while tripped
route: Route: AI gateway or the family's provider
wire: Wire format: Messages, Responses, or Chat
log: Actions log: tokens, cost, cost source
verb -> resolve
resolve -> family
family -> breaker
breaker -> route: under budget
route -> wire
wire -> log: reply priced
